OL,3,GNEWSAGardener stole gold nugget worth
OL,4,A#16k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gardener who stole a gold nugget
OL,7,Fwhich was a "treasured item" from an
OL,8,Felderly man has been sentenced.
OL,10,FLeicester Crown Court heard Christopher
OL,11,FDarlison, 42, was employed by Roger
OL,12,FBown, who died last year, to carry out
OL,13,Fgardening work and came to be viewed
OL,14,F"almost as another son".
OL,16,FHowever, prosecutor Damian Warburton
OL,17,Fsaid in July 2025, Darlison took a gold
OL,18,Fnugget from Bown's property - and sold
OL,19,Fit at a jewellers for #15,000 in cash.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
